eliver investment solutions that help investors target a broad range of outcomes and provide equity, fixed-income, alternative/private markets, multi-asset and liquidity management strategies to more than 11,000 institutions and intermediaries worldwide. Our clients include corporations, government entities, insurance companies, foundations and endowments, banks and broker/dealers. Headquartered in Pittsburgh, Federated Hermes has more than 2,200 employees in London, New York, Boston and offices worldwide .","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1056288/000105628826000024/a991-2026q2earningspressre.htm","filed":"2026-07-30","source":"8-K"}}